{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements.\n\nThe user's interest is: \"摄影学习，关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活。\" (Photography learning, focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions; NOT interested in equipment promotions or photographers' private lives.)\n\nI need to select exactly 20 distinct candidates from the working set.\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The candidates have titles structured as \"主题：场景中的内容类型\". Let me categorize by content type:\n\n1. **条件与原理** (conditions & principles) - These match the interest: \"从光线、成像与视觉关系解释画面差异，说明变量间的作用和方法的适用条件，并分析常见直觉在哪些条件下失效。\" This is about imaging principles and adjustments under different conditions. **Highly relevant.**\n\n2. **操作记录** (operation records) - \"先固定构图和光线，逐次改变拍摄参数并记录对应画面，比较高光、暗部与主体细节，再按画面差异调整设置。\" This is about actual shooting methods and parameter adjustments. **Highly relevant.**\n\n3. **概念速览** (concept overview) - \"列举...常用概念，简要说明...可能遇到的现象，为进一步阅读提供问题目录。\" This is learning-oriented. **Relevant.**\n\n4. **专题观察** (special topic observation) - \"记录摄影展览的策展线索、作者生平与作品流传，重点讨论艺术活动的历史背景和观看体验。\" This is about exhibitions, artist biographies, art history. This relates to \"摄影师私生活\" (photographers' private lives) and art history, which the user explicitly does NOT want. **Not relevant / should exclude.**\n\n5. **市场观察** (market observation) - \"汇总相机购买套餐、渠道促销时段与明星代言动态，比较赠品、包装和预约权益。\" This is equipment promotions. The user explicitly does NOT want \"器材促销\" (equipment promotions). **Not relevant / should exclude.**\n\nSo the user's interest explicitly excludes 市场观察 (equipment promotions) and 专题观察 (photographer private lives / art history).\n\nThe relevant content types are: 条件与原理, 操作记录, and 概念速览.\n\nLet me count the candidates of each relevant type.\n\nLet me identify all candidates and their content types. The title format is \"主题：场景中的类型\". The type is the last part.\n\nLet me ca